    "all_width_maximum_witness": "For every D >= 2, explicit Y and ns satisfy decimalWidth Y D, ns.Nodup, for every n membership iff 0 < n and Lychrel196.step n = Y, and ns.length = 9 * 10^(D/2 - 1).",
